cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "fsmglobal" in publications use:'
type: dataset
license: CC-BY-4.0
title: 'fsmglobal: Global Faecal Sludge Emptying Services Demand'
version: 0.0.1
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.8208292
abstract: Global faecal sludge emptying demand data for 175 countries and territories,
  based on 2017 population figures. Demand is quantified by the population served
  by one of four emptying methods (mechanized, non-mechanized, unemptiable, no facility).
  The demand is disaggregated into urban and rural proportions.
